    {
      "id": "c200000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧠 Phase 0 simulation roadmap\n\nBuild one auditable basketball brain in measured steps. Each phase must leave evidence before the next brain capability is trusted.",
      "x": -300,
      "y": -850,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ⚙️ Phase 0A\n\n✅ **ENGINE COMPLETE**\n\nTwo teams · ten athletes · strict action contract · deterministic resolver · decision tape · JSONL events · replay · legality checks",
      "x": -1700,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 📊 Phase 0B\n\n🧪 **BASELINE ESTABLISHED**\n\n1,000 games · team/player aggregation · calibration guardrails · reproducible report · rebound concentration corrected",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🤖 Phase 0C\n\n🧪 **OFFLINE GATE COMPLETE**\n\nLegal-action list · sports-only context · strict JSON validation · deterministic fallback · provider telemetry · exact replay\n\n🧠 6 recorded LLM scenarios verified\n🔒 Live provider awaits budget approval.",
      "x": -300,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🗓️ Phase 0D\n\n◇ **SEASONS + PREDICTION VALIDATION**\n\nSchedules, standings, history, injuries, fatigue progression, public information, strength differences, and meaningful prediction testing.",
      "x": 450,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎮 Phase 0.5\n\n◇ **FUNCTIONAL SPORTS LOOP**\n\nBrowse teams and schedules · lock predictions · simulate server-side · replay events · settle credits through the auditable ledger",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
