    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ✅ Current calibration\n\n**9 / 9 checks passed**\n\n🏀 92.12 team PPG\n⏱️ 206.62 total possessions\n🎯 38.3% FG\n3️⃣ 26.9% 3PA share\n🔁 9.19 turnovers/team\n🏠 50.0% home wins\n⌛ 2.8% overtime",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🔧 Demonstrated fix\n\nThe original maximum-rating shortcut awarded nearly every rebound to one athlete. Weighted assignment reduced the maximum from roughly **68** to **16.79 rebounds per game**.",
      "x": 180,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c20000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧍 Shared Athlete Life Brain\n\n⏸ **AFTER THE CORE SPORTS LOOP IS STABLE**\n\nTrain · rest · recover · socialize first. Relationships, nightlife, media, discipline, and career decisions expand later across every sport.",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
