    },
    {
      "id": "c20000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🛡️ AI safety gate\n\n✅ 8,140 structured decisions\n✅ 6/6 recorded LLM actions legal\n✅ 6/6 request hashes verified\n✅ Exact full-game replay\n💳 $0 paid API cost\n\n🚫 No seed, probabilities, credits, wagers, wallet, purchase, or payment data in AI context.",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c20000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ⚖️ Paired fairness gate\n\n✅ 100 seeds · 200 swapped-home games\n✅ 5/5 checks passed\n🏠 53.0% aggregate home wins\n↔️ 6.0% maximum team side gap\n🔁 200/200 exact replays\n\nNext no-cost gate: tamper-evident replay manifest.",
